WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:07.542
The actors in this tv show
have been shielded from the press,

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:12.375
but their characters have lived their
lives on the tv screen and social media.

00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:16.125
Tonight two of the main characters
speak publicly for the first time.

00:00:16.292 --> 00:00:19.792
Please welcome Tarjei Sandvik Moe
and Josefine Pettersen.

00:00:30.042 --> 00:00:34.000
Welcome.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.125
Please sit.

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:43.625
We started the show by talking to Laleh,

00:00:43.792 --> 00:00:45.792
and she said she wanted to be herself.

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:49.917
And this is the first time
you will be yourselves

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.292
and not Isak or Nora,

00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:56.625
the characters the Norwegian
and Danish audience know you as.

00:00:56.792 --> 00:00:59.125
How does that feel?

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:01.875
It's a little bit scary.

00:01:02.042 --> 00:01:06.042
I love being an actor
and portray other people.

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:10.167
But we can try this.

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:12.458
-Are you ok?
-Yes.

00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:18.167
It's nice that people
can get to know us as well.

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:22.667
A lot of people have been wondering
what we're like.

00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:26.083
My daughter came to me and said:

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:30.750
"How do they know what life is like
for my friends and I?"

00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:37.125
That made me very curious
and I wanted to watch all of it.

00:01:37.292 --> 00:01:39.875
You see what it's like to be young.

00:01:40.042 --> 00:01:44.375
A lot of the response
is that it feels very real.

00:01:44.542 --> 00:01:49.000
What's the secret?

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:53.917
-It's Julie Andem.
-The director.

00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:56.625
And screenwriter.

00:01:56.792 --> 00:02:01.750
They've done a lot of research

00:02:01.917 --> 00:02:07.583
and have had chats with 16 year olds
about what life is like.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:10.083
They studied them, in a way.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:14.167
That's how they did it.

00:02:15.208 --> 00:02:18.417
She also spoke to us a lot.

00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:22.917
She'll ask me: "How does this work?"
And I'll tell her.

00:02:23.083 --> 00:02:28.958
I'm cheating. Because I'm portraying
a sophomore at Nissen high school,

00:02:29.125 --> 00:02:35.042
and that's what I am in real life.

00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:40.458
So I know what it's like to be young.

00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:44.375
-You're 17. You're a little bit older.
-20.

00:02:44.542 --> 00:02:48.333
-You portray a younger girl.
-A 16 year old.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:53.250
Has that been hard?

00:02:53.417 --> 00:02:59.000
Not really.
16 doesn't feel like that long ago.

00:02:59.167 --> 00:03:03.750
Jeg remember starting high school.
I remember what it was like.

00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:10.292
It's a little bit different now that I'm
20. You feel a lot more grown up.

00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:16.375
Do people still think you're 16?

00:03:16.542 --> 00:03:20.542
In Norway people only know you as Nora.

00:03:20.708 --> 00:03:23.542
A lot of people think I'm Nora.

00:03:23.708 --> 00:03:27.833
I was out in Trondheim. You had to
be 20 to get in, and I am 20.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:32.958
Så I wanted to go out
and have a good time with two friends.

00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:37.208
I was sitting there drinking a beer,

00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:41.500
and one of the security staff came up
to me and said: "Come with me."

00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:44.667
I just... Ok.

00:03:44.833 --> 00:03:48.958
I thought he was
going to give me free alcohol.

00:03:52.917 --> 00:03:56.000
I said: "Fine, I'm coming."

00:03:56.167 --> 00:04:00.542
"Can you show me some ID?"
"Yes."

00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:04.042
"This isn't you."

00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:07.833
I said: "I know.
I look very young in that photo."

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:12.042
"I was 15."
"I know it's not you."

00:04:12.208 --> 00:04:15.708
"Ok. What's the..."

00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:20.917
He said: "I've talked to a lot of people
tonight. I know this ID is fake."

00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:24.833
"You're 16 years old
and your name is Nora."

00:04:27.042 --> 00:04:30.875
I got really stressed.

00:04:31.042 --> 00:04:34.750
"I'm an actress in a tv show
where I play Nora who's 16."

00:04:34.917 --> 00:04:40.417
He said: "Ok. Yeah, sure."

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.583
He didn't believe me.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:48.542
He said: "We need to call the police.
Come with me."

00:04:48.708 --> 00:04:52.792
He called the cops and I had to
answer questions about myself.

00:04:52.958 --> 00:04:57.250
Tell them where I've lived,
tell them about my parents.

00:04:57.417 --> 00:05:01.208
Finally I said:
"Can't you just google me?"

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:13.542
It turned out ok. I got a humble apology.

00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:16.000
-Did you get a free beer?
-No.

00:05:16.167 --> 00:05:20.708
I got my beer back. It was on the floor.

00:05:24.083 --> 00:05:29.583
You're 17 and you've never had beer

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.917
or any other alcohol.
-Of course not.

